@startsalt
' Screen: Webhook Settings
' User Stories:
'   - As a developer, I want to register webhook endpoints for org events
'   - As a developer, I want to choose which event types trigger each webhook
'   - As a developer, I want to send a test delivery to verify my endpoint
'   - As a developer, I want to see recent delivery logs to debug failures

{
  ' Top nav
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Runs | Review Queue | <b>Settings</b>
    .
    <i>Acme Engineering</i> | keith@noizu.com
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Organization Settings — Acme Engineering</b>
  }
  --
  {
    ' Sidebar
    {+
      <b>Settings</b>
      --
      General
      Members
      API Tokens
      SSO
      Freeball
      <b>Webhooks</b>
      Audit Log
    }
    |
    ' Content
    {
      <b>Webhooks</b>
      ==
      ' Existing webhook list
      {#
        <b>URL</b> | <b>Status</b> | <b>Events</b> | <b>Last Delivery</b> | <b>Actions</b>
        https://ci.acme.com/hooks/codefresh | <color:green>Active</color> | run.completed, score.below_threshold | <color:green>2026-05-12 09:15 — 200 OK</color> | [Edit] [Test] [Delete]
        https://hooks.slack.com/T01A/B09Z/... | <color:green>Active</color> | freeball.pending | <color:green>2026-05-11 14:22 — 200 OK</color> | [Edit] [Test] [Delete]
        https://legacy.acme.com/notify | <color:red>Failing</color> | run.completed | <color:red>2026-05-10 08:01 — 503 (5 retries)</color> | [Edit] [Test] [Disable] [Delete]
      }
      --
      [+ New Webhook]
      ==
      ' Create / edit form
      {+
        <b>New Webhook</b>
        --
        <b>Endpoint URL</b>
        "https://your-server.example.com/webhook   "
        --
        <b>Secret</b> <i>(used to sign payloads — store securely)</i>
        "whsec_••••••••••••••••••••••••••••   " [Regenerate]
        --
        <b>Events to send:</b>
        --
        [X] run.completed         — Fired when a run finishes (pass or fail)
        [X] freeball.pending      — Fired when a freeball needs review
        [X] score.below_threshold — Fired when overall score drops below org threshold
        [ ] member.invited        — Fired when a new member is invited
        [ ] token.created         — Fired when an API token is created
        [ ] sso.failed            — Fired when SSO authentication fails
        --
        [Save Webhook] | [Cancel]
      }
      ==
      ' Delivery log
      {+
        <b>Delivery Log — https://ci.acme.com/hooks/codefresh</b>
        --
        {#
          <b>Event</b> | <b>Timestamp</b> | <b>Status</b> | <b>Duration</b> | <b>Actions</b>
          run.completed | 2026-05-12 09:15:04 | <color:green>200 OK</color> | 142ms | [View Payload]
          score.below_threshold | 2026-05-11 22:03:17 | <color:green>200 OK</color> | 98ms | [View Payload]
          run.completed | 2026-05-11 18:44:52 | <color:red>500 Error</color> | 5000ms (timeout) | [View Payload] [Redeliver]
        }
        --
        [View Full Delivery Log]
      }
    }
  }
}

@endsalt
